  "class": "three classes of worlds: a rotation about x added to the pulses (on all pulses, on q8's or on q4's), a rotation about y or z added before or after them (same scopes), and the two selector readout worlds; a class is preferred when its best world is adequate and the best world of each other class sits at least 25.0 above it; the x class is excluded when the two other classes lead, the leader is adequate, the best x world is inadequate and it sits at least 25.0 above the leader; every label is a preference among the modeled worlds and noise models",
  "control": "the inverse-variance mean of the center arm's contrast over the admitted scan batches exceeds 3.0 standard errors; within 3.0 standard errors of zero the offset is absent, below that it is reversed, and either way no mechanism is decided",
